<title>USA: SEC grants Hospitality Prop $500 mln.</title>
<headline>SEC grants Hospitality Prop $500 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospitality Properties Trust said Tuesday the Securities and Exchange Commission had declared effective its shelf registration for up to $500 million of securities, including debt securities.</p>
<p>Hospitality said it planned to use the net proceeds from the sale of the securities for &quot;general trust purposes,&quot; which may include the acquisition of, or other investments in, hotel and lodging related properties and the repayment of indebtedness.</p>
</text>
